WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.420
Taking the four species is a daytime

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:03.060
mitzvah.

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:05.320
Set a morning cue and a same

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:06.500
-day recovery reminder

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.860
so a missed first opportunity does not

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:09.840
become a missed day.
